sequenceDiagram
    participant SFTP as Internal SFTP Server
    participant SENSOR as Airflow SFTP Sensor
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>pipeline.file_catalogue<br/>pipeline.ingestion_file_state
    participant DAG1 as Airflow DAG 1<br/>Transfer
    participant S3R as S3 Raw Zone<br/>ods-raw-{env}
    participant EB as AWS EventBridge<br/>ods-raw-file-rule-{env}
    participant DAG2 as Airflow DAG 2<br/>ETL
    participant CFG as S3 Config<br/>ods-config-{env}
    participant GLUE as Glue ETL Job<br/>(see detail diagram)
    participant S3C as S3 Curated Zone<br/>ods-curated-{env}
    participant CAT as Glue Data Catalog<br/>ods_{domain}
    participant AUDIT as MSK Audit Topic<br/>ods.pipeline.audit
    participant QUAR as S3 Quarantine<br/>ods-quarantine-{env}
    participant DLQ as S3 DLQ<br/>ods-dlq-{env}

    Note over SFTP,PG: DAG 1 · Phase 1 — Detect & Validate
    SENSOR->>SFTP: ❶ Poll for new CSV files (every 5 min)
    SFTP-->>SENSOR: ❷ New file detected (filename + path)
    SENSOR->>PG: ❸ Check file_catalogue — is this file approved?
    alt Not approved
        PG-->>SENSOR: No match found
        SENSOR->>QUAR: ❹ Quarantine file + emit alert
    else Approved
        PG-->>SENSOR: Approved — domain, dataset, config ref
        SENSOR->>PG: ❺ Check ingestion_file_state — already processed?
        alt Already processed
            PG-->>SENSOR: status=completed → skip
        else New file
            PG-->>SENSOR: status=new → proceed
            SENSOR->>DAG1: ❻ Trigger DAG 1 (file path + catalogue ref)
            DAG1->>PG: ❼ Set file state → detected
        end
    end

    Note over DAG1,S3R: DAG 1 · Phase 2 — Transfer
    DAG1->>SFTP: ❽ SFTPToS3Operator — copy CSV to S3 Raw
    SFTP-->>S3R: File transferred
    DAG1->>S3R: ❾ Verify MD5 checksum
    alt Checksum mismatch
        DAG1->>QUAR: Route corrupt file to quarantine
        DAG1->>PG: Set file state → failed (checksum)
        DAG1->>AUDIT: Emit audit event (status=failed · reason=checksum)
    else Checksum verified
        DAG1->>PG: ❿ Set file state → transferred
    end

    Note over S3R,DAG2: EventBridge Handoff
    S3R->>EB: ⓫ Object Created event (new CSV in S3 Raw)
    EB->>DAG2: ⓬ Trigger DAG 2 — ETL (file path from event)

    Note over DAG2,S3C: DAG 2 · Phase 3 — Glue ETL (schema · CSV→Parquet — see detail diagram)
    DAG2->>CFG: ⓭ Load config (resolve pinned S3 version ID)
    CFG-->>DAG2: schema ref · output path · key fields
    DAG2->>GLUE: ⓮ Trigger Glue ETL job (config ref + S3 version ID)
    GLUE->>S3R: ⓯ Read CSV file (source path from config)
    S3R-->>GLUE: CSV data + row count
    alt ETL failed (schema · conversion)
        GLUE-->>DLQ: Failed records routed to DLQ with reason
        GLUE-->>DAG2: Job failed
        DAG2->>PG: Set file state → failed
        DAG2->>AUDIT: ⓰ Emit audit event (status=failed · reason · dataset)
    else ETL succeeded
        GLUE-->>S3C: Parquet written (partitioned by date)
        GLUE-->>DAG2: Job completed
    end

    Note over DAG2,AUDIT: DAG 2 · Phase 4 — Post-ETL
    DAG2->>CAT: ⓱ Register dataset in Glue Data Catalog
    DAG2->>PG: ⓲ Set file state → completed
    DAG2->>AUDIT: ⓳ Emit audit event (status=success · record_count · dataset)
    Note over S3C: ⓴ Parquet in S3 Curated triggers Publish Pipeline EventBridge rule
